-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- a type checker over the machine
-- types are bodies: constructor 1 a function type (a domain and a function giving the codomain), 2
-- the universe, 3 the numbers, 4 a path type (a line of types and the two ends), 5 the interval,
-- 10 and 11 its ends. Conversion is the machine's: two types are the same when their normal forms
-- are
nk-fail : NkTm
nk-fail = nk-con #99 nk-nil
